                                                "text": "\"He came in. He had a gun. He was crazy. You can see he was crazy; look what he did to Ricky. He thought Ricky was me. He wanted to steal my adjustables. Look.\"\nSonny smiled and tilted the steel case so Henry could look at the jumble of rusty ironmongery inside."
